h> is run\n    Then: warns 'Specs section found but no YAML code block detected — wrap specs in triple-backtick yaml block' and exits with 0 specs 0 tasks\n  [ac-35]\n    Given: A plan file with specs that include depends_on arrays referencing other specs\n    When: kspec plan import <path> is run\n    Then: Specs are created with depends_on populated; derived tasks inherit depends_on mapped from spec slugs to their corresponding task slugs; manual tasks honor depends_on directly\n  [ac-36]\n    Given: A plan file with specs that include a priority field (1-5)\n    When: kspec plan import <path> is run with derive_from_specs: true\n    Then: Derived tasks inherit the priority from their source spec; specs without priority default to 3\n  [ac-37]\n    Given: A plan file with AC fields containing unquoted colons (e.g. then: User sees error: Invalid)\n    When: kspec plan import <path> is run and YAML parsing fails\n    Then: Error message includes diagnostic hints identifying the specific field and line with the unquoted colon, plus a fix suggestion to use YAML block scalars\n\nRemember: Add test coverage for each AC and mark tests with // AC: @spec-ref ac-N\n\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":3,"nanos":188374826},"formatted_output":"OK Started task: 01KJDQ1C2\n\n--- Spec Context ---\nImplementing: Plan Document Import\n\nParse structured plan documents with ## Specs YAML blocks, auto-generate specs and tasks, handle errors gracefully\n\nAcceptance Criteria (25):\n  [ac-11]\n    Given: A plan file with ## Specs YAML block exists\n    When: kspec plan import <path> is run\n    Then: Specs are parsed from YAML, validated against schema, and created in order (parents before children)\n  [ac-12]\n    Given: A plan file with derive_from_specs: true in Tasks section\n    When: kspec plan import <path> is run\n    Then: Tasks are auto-derived from each created spec, with plan_ref linking to imported plan\n  [ac-13]\n    Given: A plan file has per-spec implementation_notes 